msgid ""
"Bedford Police Department\n"
"2 Mudge Way\n"
"Bedford, MA 01730\n"
"PHONE: 781-555-2788\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: police mugshot of a distraught young woman with long blonde hair.]\n"
"\n"
"Bedford Police Department Missing Persons Unit Investigators are asking for the public's help locating Sophia Breece.  She lives on 4307 Lyon Avenue, Worcester, and was last seen on April 30 at approximately 6 p.m.\n"
"\n"
"Mrs. Breece is a female Caucasian 30 years old, 5'3\" tall, 100-105 pounds, blonde curled hair, with blue eyes.\n"
"\n"
"MP has a history of substance abuse.  Her loved ones are very worried and asking for your help locating her.\n"
"\n"
