"[Photograph: a teenaged boy in a flannel shirt sitting on a couch.]\n"
"Daniel Dunn\n"
"\n"
"13 years old, white, 5'3\", blond, blue eyes.  Daniel left home at 2:00 pm telling his mother he was going to visit a friend's house on Union Street.  Daniel lives on Poplar Drive.  His family reported him missing at 8:00 pm.\n"
"David was wearing a red flannel shirt, light brown jeans and green sneakers.  David is left-handed and misses an upper incisor.\n"
