"[Photograph: a teenaged girl in a knitted hoodie taking a selfie with a flower.]\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE SPREAD THE WORD: \"Find Lela Otten\" on Facebook!\n"
"\n"
"Lela Otten is 15 and went missing on 16 March at around 16:30.  She was last seen at the park on Lincoln Street, Easton.  She was wearing a dark green shirt with striped jeans.  Lela suffers from epilepsy and we are very worried about her.  Please come home soon, Lela.  We all miss you and want you home safe.\n"
"\n"
"MAKE A DIFFERENCE TO FAMILIES THAT NEED YOUR HELP - VISIT\n"
"www.together-again.org"
msgstr ""

