msgid ""
"ISS MUTINIES, ABANDONS STATION.  Making their demands known through amateur "
"radio communications, all astronauts and cosmonauts aboard the International "
"Space Station have demanded that NASA and ROSCOSMOS allow them to rejoin "
"their families amidst the recent riots and instability.  Claims have been "
"made that the agencies have shut them out of most controls aboard the "
"station, endangering the lives of all aboard when they were unable to respond"
